invalid type: string "Item: Old house toilet key\n\nShort Name: Depot T.\nType: keys\nCategory: Mechanical Key\nDescription: A worn-out key to the outhouse in an old house somewhere on the edge of the Priozersk nature reserve. It feels like it's been used many times. Why the outhouse was locked and what treasures it might hide is a mystery.\nBase Price: 700000\nFlea Market Level: 25\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ